# Copyrighted game patch sets (CivNet etc.) — resolved at build time from
# build-inputs/patches/ or downloaded (see external_patches.go). Never commit.
# Exception: civ3's overlay is self-authored config (conquests.ini launch
# recipe + a minimal Text/version.txt "#LANGUAGE 0"), no game content — it
# must ship in the repo for the embedded build to work.
